<title>USA: Jordan to tender for 50,000 T barley - trade.</title>
<headline>Jordan to tender for 50,000 T barley - trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jordan is expected to tender later this month for 50,000 tonnes optional origin barley slated for January shipment, several U.S. exporters said.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
</text>
